        [3] = {
          body = "# Gen1 Modern UI v0.8.1\13\
\13\
This release contains the compatibility and presentation work added after the\13\
published [v0.8.0 release](https://github.com/ArmstrongThomas/gen1-modern-ui/releases/tag/v0.8.0).\13\
\13\
## Highlights\13\
\13\
### Compatibility foundation\13\
\13\
- Added the versioned `mod.exports.gen1ModernUi` contract (`apiVersion = 1`)\13\
  for source-mod-owned screen models, semantic actions, public image catalogs,\13\
  themes, and pixel frames.\13\
- Added adapter discovery through `mod.find(...).exports`, namespaced\13\
  registration, API/model validation, error isolation, and safe cache\13\
  invalidation when mods reload or become disabled.\13\
- Models remain read-only presentation data. Source mods retain ownership of\13\
  callbacks, validation, networking, state transitions, and semantic actions.\13\
- Rejected custom third-party draw callbacks, private-state reach-through, and\13\
  arbitrary file execution. Missing, malformed, unsupported, disabled, or\13\
  failing integrations fall back to vanilla rendering.\13\
- Added preferred `screen.render_visible` suppression with the older\13\
  `render.compose` fallback for hosts without the newer hook.\13\
- Added documented drop-in examples for generic adapters, RBYMMO, Dex Radar,\13\
  OptionRows menus, and Useful Bag.\13\
\13\
### Themes, frames, and fonts\13\
\13\
- Added source-mod registration for multiple namespaced themes and pixel\13\
  frames, including source-owned PNG/image assets and the shared\13\
  nearest-neighbor nine-slice renderer.\13\
- Preserved integer pixel scaling, repeating edge slices, and the seven-pixel\13\
  authored frame inset for custom PNG borders.\13\
- Added high-contrast **Light** and **Dark** themes and improved text, divider,\13\
  selection, and health-bar colors across the built-in palettes.\13\
- Kept the normal UI font on the lightweight host path and added automatic\13\
  non-Latin Unicode detection. Screens containing Japanese, CJK, Cyrillic,\13\
  Greek, Arabic, emoji, or other non-Latin text automatically use the game's\13\
  Plain Pixel font without adding a large fallback font to the mod package.\13\
\13\
### Mod integrations\13\
\13\
- Added compatibility coverage and documentation for RBYMMO profile, rank,\13\
  character-selection, map-player, party-marker, portrait, and public profile\13\
  data paths.\13\
- Added compatibility bridges for Gen 3 Box, Useful Dex, Modern Bag/Bag 999,\13\
  Item Shortcut, PC/shop extensions, and Quality-of-Life location banners,\13\
  while preserving their live state and source-owned callbacks.\13\
- Fixed the current standalone Useful Bag integration so its pocketed item\13\
  lists continue using the modern Items/Shop presentation while Useful Bag\13\
  retains pocket switching, sorting, selection, and callbacks.\13\
- Added DV Tracker Summary page support for DV and Stat EXP data, including the\13\
  tracker’s derived HP DV behavior and its `dvs`/`ivs` fallbacks.\13\
- Kept existing Dex Radar support while documenting its adapter migration path\13\
  for future source-owned exports.\13\
- Extended pointer hover/select routing for contract-backed rows while keeping\13\
  source-owned semantic actions and native keyboard/controller behavior intact.\13\
\13\
### Documentation and verification\13\
\13\
- Added the custom UI/theme API guide, interoperability audit, handoff notes,\13\
  roadmap updates, source-mod templates, and compatibility examples.\13\
- Added contract, Useful Bag shape, suppression, fallback, and malformed-data\13\
  regression coverage to the local test fixtures.\13\
- Added release/package guidance for the multilingual font fallback behavior.\13\
\13\
## Compatibility\13\
\13\
The release remains visual-only and targets gen1recomp `>=0.1.51 <2.0.0`.\13\
Source mods retain state transitions, callbacks, networking, and semantic\13\
input ownership. Unsupported future screens remain on the classic renderer.",
