        [4] = {
          body = "# Gen1 Modern UI v0.8.0\
\
High-resolution, themeable menu presentation for released gen1recomp builds.\
\
## Changes in this release\
\
- Add Dex Radar UI support (1b07b4a)\
\
## Quick start\
\
1. Download **gen1_modern_ui-0.8.0.zip** from the Assets section below.\
2. In gen1recomp, open **Mods → Import mod .zip** and select the archive.\
3. Confirm the import, then enable **Gen1 Modern UI** under **UI**.\
4. Restart the game if prompted.\
\
The launcher extracts and installs the package automatically; manual\
archive extraction is not required.\
\
## Compatibility and notes\
\
- Requires gen1recomp v0.1.51 or newer (and remains compatible with 1.x).\
- Keeps vanilla input/state ownership and reads live rows from other mods.\
- Presents complete compatible dialogue/action/quantity stacks without replacing callbacks.\
- Includes responsive title/Start, Trainer Card, Party, Bill's PC, Pokédex, Bag, Shop, and Player-PC views.\
- Shows Pokémon stats/moves, Trainer ID, and BASE/SELL item values including TMs.\
- Adds a presentation-only MINIMAL UI mode for closer-to-original layouts.\
- Uses world-visible floating cards on desktop and mobile while retaining responsive layouts.\
- Hides supported classic UI canvases while preserving the independently rendered world.\
- **HIDE ORIGINAL UI** can restore the classic layer as a compatibility fallback.\
- Includes classic and modern themes in opaque and glass variants.\
- Supports active sprite replacement packs and nearest-neighbor artwork.\
- Battle UI remains WIP and disabled by default.\
\
