          body = "# Gen1 Modern UI v0.7.2\13\
\13\
## Highlights\13\
\13\
- Added independent UI scaling from 75%–150%.\13\
- Added independent font scaling from 80%–200%.\13\
- Added dialogue text scaling presets through 200%.\13\
- Scaling now occurs before measurement and layout, with cached fonts and theme metrics.\13\
- Added readable row wrapping and long-word handling for menus and dialogue.\13\
- Rich presenters now grow vertically with higher readability scales when the\13\
  window has available space, revealing more usable content.\13\
- Added large-window scaling coverage for Bag, Shop, PC, Party, Pokédex,\13\
  Summary, and other rich presenters.\13\
- Horizontal YES/NO choice layouts now support LEFT/RIGHT navigation as\13\
  aliases for UP/DOWN.\13\
- Fixed a crash path for Nidoran names containing the Gen1 male/female signs.\13\
- Made text truncation UTF-8 character-safe so multi-byte names are never cut\13\
  into invalid strings before LÖVE measures or renders them.\13\
- Added readable `NIDORAN M` / `NIDORAN F` fallbacks when the overlay font lacks\13\
  the gender glyphs.\13\
- Added normal, high-scale, portrait, and landscape Nidoran regression shots.\13\
- Exported public `scaleTokens` and `getScaleTokens()` theme API helpers.\13\
- Preserved the visual-only architecture: game state, callbacks, input\13\
  ownership, and third-party menu data remain engine-owned.\13\
\13\
