        [20] = {
          body = "# Gen1 Modern UI v0.1.0\13\
\13\
The first public release of Gen1 Modern UI, a standalone high-resolution UI overhaul for [gen1recomp](https://github.com/bryanthaboi/gen1recomp).\13\
\13\
## Highlights\13\
\13\
- Responsive portrait and landscape layouts\13\
- Modernized menus for party, options, summaries, Pokédex, PC boxes, and the mod manager\13\
- Useful Dex and Gen 3 Box presentation support\13\
- Compatibility with other mods’ menu entries and UI additions\13\
- Support for enabled sprite replacement packs such as Gold/Silver sprites\13\
- Themeable colors, spacing, typography, and density\13\
- Nearest-neighbor rendering with aspect-ratio-preserving artwork\13\
- Lightweight draw-only presentation that preserves vanilla input and state handling\13\
\13\
## Installation\13\
\13\
1. Download `gen1_modern_ui-0.1.0.zip`.\13\
2. Extract it into:\13\
\13\
   `%APPDATA%\\pokemon-love2d\\mods\\gen1_modern_ui`\13\
\13\
3. Make sure `manifest.json` and `main.lua` are directly inside that folder.\13\
4. Restart gen1recomp.\13\
5. Enable **Gen1 Modern UI** under **Mods → UI** if necessary.\13\
\13\
## Current limitations\13\
\13\
- Battle UI support is still experimental and disabled by default.\13\
- Touch/click activation remains handled by the game’s existing controls.\13\
- Unsupported third-party screens fall back to their original presentation.\13\
\13\
Feedback, bug reports, compatibility requests, and new screen suggestions are welcome through the [issue tracker](https://github.com/ArmstrongThomas/gen1-modern-ui/issues).",
          downloads = 11,
          name = "Gen1 Modern UI v0.1.0",
