| --- | --- |\13\
| left stick | move — grid-walks the diorama, free-walks 1ST |\13\
| A / B (X / Y on the left hand) | A / B |\13\
| either trigger | START |\13\
| left stick click | step the VOXEL angle ladder (same as the \"3\" key) |\13\
| right stick up / down | *diorama only* — zoom the model |\13\
| right stick left / right | *1ST only* — snap-turn 45° |\13\
| grip squeeze + raise / lower that hand | *diorama only* — drag the table's height |\13\
| head | *1ST and battles* — look; FreeMove walks where you look |\13\
| left hand | *1ST and battles* — the Pokédex: menus, dialogs and the 2D battle screen on its screen |\13\
