Initial release for the Dramatic Shape Voxel Mod for the Gen1 Recomp Project. Currently supported on version [0.1.30](https://github.com/bryanthaboi/pokemon-gen1-recomp-project/releases/tag/v0.1.30).\13\
\13\
| control | does |\13\
| --- | --- |\13\
| `3`, or the **VOXEL** options row | OFF → 15 → 35 → 50 → 75 → OFF (camera pitch) |\13\
| `5`, or the **V-GRID** options row | OFF / ON — a one-pixel wireframe on every voxel |\13\
| `6`, or the **T-SHIFT** options row | OFF → 1 → 2 → 3 → OFF (miniature blur) |\13\
| `7`, or the **V-CURVE** options row | OFF → 1 → 2 → 3 — bend the world over the horizon |\13\
\13\
Download the zip -> Load it via the mod manager.\13\
",
          downloads = 466,
          name = "1.1.0 - 3Dish battles",
          prerelease = false,
          published = "2026-07-28",
          tag = "1.1.0",
          version = "1.1.0",
          zip = {
            name = "DRAMATIC_SHAPE-1.1.0.zip",
            size = 392964,
            url = "https://github.com/DramaticShape/DramaticShapeVoxelMod/releases/download/1.1.0/DRAMATIC_SHAPE-1.1.0.zip",
          },
        },
        [19] = {
          body = "### Standing scenery\13\
\13\
- Flowers stand up as thin cutouts and keep swaying\13\
- Viridian Forest grew real round trees and stumps\13\
- Cuttable bushes, gym statues, Lt. Surge's trash cans, and the Indigo Plateau statues all stand up properly\13\
- Tall grass reads as one clump per tile instead of two cut-off stubs\13\
\13\
### Interiors\13\
\13\
- Every interior in the game is now furnished — 23 tilesets, roughly 130 maps, up from 10\13\
- Fixed rooms that rendered as a floor in a moat with no walls, including all 25 route gates\13\
- Counters sit at the right height, shelves no longer fuse into deep blocks, and furniture that used to be invisible is back — stools, staircases, tables, and 314 gravestones in Pokémon Tower\13\
- Poké Marts and the Pokémon League lobby brought up to the same standard\13\
\13\
### Buildings and terrain\13\
\13\
- The Pokémon Tower now stands as one building; its drawing spans two maps, so each half used to fold up separately\13\
- Cliffs and cave mounds stopped sprouting random towers, and ledge lines run unbroken\13\
- Shorelines no longer open into the sky beside buildings, and edge-row buildings keep their walls and eaves across map borders\13\
- Caves sit above water level throughout, with real climbing ladders\13\
\13\
### Quality of life\13\
\13\
- Your character shows through anything standing in front of them, so you never lose track of where you are\13\
- Cut trees actually disappear when you cut them, and grow back when you re-enter\13\
- Editing the world no longer flashes the flat 2D view for a moment\13\
- Android fixed: the world drew into a corner of the screen at a fraction of its proper size\13\
\13\
-------------------\13\
\13\
DISCLAIMER: Still a work in progress, so expect a lot of unfinished or wonky voxelizations.\13\
\13\
Initial release for the Dramatic Shape Voxel Mod for the Gen1 Recomp Project. Currently supported on version [0.1.28](https://github.com/bryanthaboi/pokemon-gen1-recomp-project/releases/tag/v0.1.28).\13\
\13\
| control | does |\13\
| --- | --- |\13\
| `3`, or the **VOXEL** options row | OFF → 15 → 35 → 50 → 75 → OFF (camera pitch) |\13\
| `5`, or the **V-GRID** options row | OFF / ON — a one-pixel wireframe on every voxel |\13\
| `6`, or the **T-SHIFT** options row | OFF → 1 → 2 → 3 → OFF (miniature blur) |\13\
| `7`, or the **V-CURVE** options row | OFF → 1 → 2 → 3 — bend the world over the horizon |\13\
\13\
Download the zip -> Load it via the mod manager.\13\
",
