        [2] = {
          body = "## Wilds of Kanto 1.12.0\13\
\13\
Another big polish and compatibility update for Wilds of Kanto.\13\
\13\
A huge shoutout to **TRW / TheRhysWyrill** for the massive amount of sprite work, palette/grayscale fixes, water sprite improvements, testing and miscellaneous fixes that went into this release.\13\
\13\
### What's new\13\
\13\
- Major follower sprite overhaul\13\
- Added dedicated grayscale sprite variants for better palette compatibility\13\
- Improved submerged / water follower sprites\13\
- Water sprites now switch correctly when entering and leaving Surf\13\
- Wild water Pokémon can also use the new submerged Poke Followers / GSC sprites\13\
- Fixed follower walk cycles and dragging issues with multi-follower trains\13\
- Improved follower continuity across outdoor map connections\13\
- Improved ledge traversal and follower spacing\13\
- POKE FOLLOW EX and WILDS OF KANTO menus now use left/right steppers instead of extra dropdown menus\13\
- Follower count now applies immediately from the in-game menu\13\
- Improved party menu follower selection and deselection\13\
- Fixed several Yellow / Pikachu follower quirks\13\
- Removed the duplicate TEST SPAWN entry\13\
- Added sprite service support for external UI integrations\13\
\13\
### Compatibility\13\
\13\
- Pokémon Red\13\
- Pokémon Blue\13\
- Pokémon Yellow\13\
- Dramatic Shape Voxel Mod\13\
- Kanto in First Person\13\
- BATTLE ART - bring your own sprites!\13\
\13\
--------\13\
\13\
Also a shoutout to **jlneal** for the improvements to the follower mechanics, especially seamless map transitions, follower spacing and ledge traversal.\13\
\13\
Thanks as always to everyone testing, reporting bugs and helping improve the mod.",
