          body = "## v1.7.2\13\
\13\
### Fixed\13\
\13\
* Fixed overworld spawn behavior across all locations.\13\
* Fixed random encounter compatibility for **Pokémon Red, Blue and Yellow**.\13\
* Fixed habitat spawning to behave more consistently.\13\
* Restored vanilla Safari Zone behavior while keeping visible overworld Pokémon.\13\
* All gameplay options are now managed through the mod settings.\13\
\13\
### Improvements\13\
\13\
* Water Pokémon now always use the **PokeMMO** sprite set, providing proper swimming animations.\13\
* Improved overall stability of the spawning system.\13\
* General compatibility improvements with other mods.\13\
\13\
