        [8] = {
          body = "Wilds of Kanto v1.0.2\13\
\13\
Based on the feedback from yesterday, this update adds a much easier way to choose your preferred overworld Pokémon style.\13\
\13\
New\13\
\13\
You can now switch between these sprite styles directly from the normal in-game menu:\13\
\13\
Auto — automatically uses an installed compatible sprite pack and falls back to the built-in sprites.\13\
Gold Sprites — uses the Gold/Silver battle-front art from OtaconRevengeance’s [Gold Sprites](https://github.com/OtaconRevengeance/gold_sprites) mod (Gold_Silver_Sprites) when that mod is installed. Adapted as native 1-frame SpriteRenderer definitions (no walker sheet; no asset copy).\13\
Followers EX — uses compatible walker sprites supplied through Followers EX / PokePC Followers when those mods are installed.\13\
PokeMMO — uses the animated sprite sheets bundled with Wilds of Kanto.\13\
Pokedex — uses the original Pokédex-based images.\13\
\13\
The selected style can be changed at any time, and existing wild Pokémon update without needing to respawn.\13\
\13\
External styles require the corresponding mods to be installed:\13\
\13\
[Gold Sprites](https://github.com/OtaconRevengeance/gold_sprites/releases) (Gold_Silver_Sprites)\13\
[Followers EX](https://github.com/masterwebx/gen1recomp-followers-ex) (FOLLOWERS_EX)\13\
[PokePC Followers](https://github.com/gamecorner-033/PokePCFollowers) (PokePCFollowers_VoxelMerge), required by Followers EX\13\
\13\
If a selected sprite provider is unavailable, Wilds of Kanto automatically falls back to the next compatible style.\13\
\13\
Also included\13\
Improved sprite-provider detection\13\
Better fallback handling\13\
Updated README, credits, and installation notes\13\
Version and release metadata updated to 1.0.2\13\
\13\
Thanks again for all the feedback.\
\
## What's Changed\
* Add Sprite Style providers (Auto / Followers EX / PokeMMO / Pokedex) by @YoDrehDenSwagAuf in https://github.com/YoDrehDenSwagAuf/overworld-spawn-mod/pull/16\
* Add Gold Sprites provider + Start Menu Sprite Style picker by @YoDrehDenSwagAuf in https://github.com/YoDrehDenSwagAuf/overworld-spawn-mod/pull/17\
* Bump version to 1.0.2 (sprite providers patch) by @YoDrehDenSwagAuf in https://github.com/YoDrehDenSwagAuf/overworld-spawn-mod/pull/18\
\
\
**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/YoDrehDenSwagAuf/overworld-spawn-mod/compare/v1.0.0...v1.0.2",
