        [9] = {
          body = "# Wilds of Kanto v1.0.0\13\
\13\
The first stable release of **Wilds of Kanto** is here!\13\
\13\
This update focuses on stability, compatibility, and making the overworld feel much more alive while improving support for the latest versions of Gen1Recomp and Dramatic Shape.\13\
\13\
## 🎮 Rendering Improvements\13\
\13\
* Reworked the rendering pipeline to use the engine's native sprite rendering path\13\
* Greatly improved compatibility with **Dramatic Shape Voxel Mod**\13\
* Improved object and wall occlusion\13\
* Improved first-person compatibility\13\
* Better sprite positioning and depth handling\13\
* Removed several legacy rendering paths and fallback systems\13\
\13\
## ⚙️ Mod Improvements\13\
\13\
* Simplified the settings menu\13\
* Removed obsolete and unused options\13\
* Renamed all option labels to fit within the Gen1Recomp UI limits\13\
* Improved default configuration for new users\13\
\13\
## 🔧 Technical Changes\13\
\13\
* Native runtime sprite-sheet loading\13\
* Species are matched using **Pokédex / Species ID**\13\
* Improved fallback handling for missing assets\13\
* Cleaner renderer architecture\13\
* Updated documentation\13\
* Added GitHub update metadata\13\
* Added project license and release metadata\13\
\13\
## 🐞 Fixes\13\
\13\
* Fixed multiple rendering issues with animated overworld Pokémon\13\
* Fixed compatibility issues with Dramatic Shape\13\
* Fixed duplicate wild Pokémon spawns\13\
* Fixed various animation synchronization issues\13\
* Fixed several sprite loading edge cases\13\
\13\
## ❤️ Thanks\13\
\13\
A huge thank you to everyone who tested the mod, reported bugs, and shared feedback. Your reports helped shape this first stable release.\13\
\13\
More features—including biome-specific spawn animations, water encounters, and additional polish—are planned for future updates.\13\
\
\
## What's Changed\
* Native SpriteRenderer sheets for wild Pokemon (0.7.1) by @YoDrehDenSwagAuf in https://github.com/YoDrehDenSwagAuf/overworld-spawn-mod/pull/14\
* Wilds of Kanto 1.0.0: GitHub updates, license, simplified options by @YoDrehDenSwagAuf in https://github.com/YoDrehDenSwagAuf/overworld-spawn-mod/pull/15\
\
\
**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/YoDrehDenSwagAuf/overworld-spawn-mod/compare/v0.2.0...v1.0.0",
