        [10] = {
          body = "## 🚀 Wilds of Kanto v0.2.0\13\
\13\
A big update focused on making wild Pokémon feel much more alive while keeping full compatibility with Gen1Recomp and other mods.\13\
\13\
### ✨ New Features\13\
\13\
* Added **fully animated overworld sprites** for all **151 Generation I Pokémon**\13\
* Added support for **Shiny overworld sprites** (used when a shiny Pokémon is encountered)\13\
* Pokémon now use proper **directional Idle** and **Walk** animations\13\
* Idle Pokémon will occasionally **look around**, making the world feel much more dynamic\13\
* Walking and aggressive Pokémon now animate correctly while moving\13\
\13\
### 🌿 Gameplay Improvements\13\
\13\
* Fixed issues that could cause **duplicate overworld spawns**\13\
* Improved overworld sprite handling and overall rendering\13\
* Added a new option to control **how visible Pokémon appear inside tall grass**\13\
* Continued focus on compatibility with **Dramatic Shape Voxel Mod** and other Gen1Recomp mods\13\
\13\
### 🔄 Internal Changes\13\
\13\
* Reworked the animated overworld sprite system to use the new follow-sprite format\13\
* Species are now mapped exclusively via **Pokédex / Species ID**, making the system independent of game language\13\
* Improved fallback handling for missing sprite assets\13\
\13\
### 🔜 Coming Soon\13\
\13\
Planned for the next update:\13\
\13\
* 🌊 Water encounter animations\13\
* 🌍 Biome-specific spawn animations\13\
* Additional polish and animation improvements\13\
\13\
As always, thank you for all the feedback and bug reports. They help improve the mod with every release!\13\
",
