        [2] = {
          body = "Damage is now colour-coded by what caused it.\
\
**Install:** launcher → MODS → Import mod .zip → `damage_numbers-0.3.0.zip` → enable. Updates v0.2.0.\
\
### New\
- **Colour-coded by cause:** move (white), crit (gold frame), **recoil (red)**, **poison (purple)**, burn (orange), leech seed (green), other self-damage like confusion/trap (grey).\
- **STATUS & RECOIL** option — toggle the passive/status numbers (move damage always shows).\
\
### How\
- Recoil/confusion/trap read from a read-only `applyDamage` wrap (always returns the engine's own result).\
- Poison/burn/leech read from the visible HP-bar drain (`shownHP`), classified by `mon.status` / `leechSeeded`.\
- Still drain-synced (appears after the animation) and real-time faded (fast-forward friendly).\
\
